    "identifier": "wind-release-lions-fang-blade",
    "description": "<p>You mold wind Release Chakra to create a beast made purely of Wind Release Chakra, that has a design and look of your description that counts as large.</p>\n<p>Upon its creation, you command it to attack up to 6 creature, once each. Make a melee Ninjutsu attack for each creature it attacks within range as it leaps and assaults each creature. On a hit, you deal 8d6 wind damage.</p>\n<p>A creature that takes damage from this jutsu must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save they gain 4 ranks of Bleed.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above A-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, the damage by 2d6.</p>",
